graph LR
    KAP["kube-auth-proxy<br/>(fork of oauth2-proxy)"]

    %% External libraries / build
    KAP -->|OIDC verify| GoOIDC["coreos/go-oidc v3.18.0"]
    KAP -->|OAuth2 flows| XOAuth2["x/oauth2 v0.36.0"]
    KAP -->|JWT/JOSE| JWT["go-jose v3.0.5<br/>golang-jwt v5.3.0"]
    KAP -->|TokenReview client| ClientGo["client-go v0.35.3"]
    KAP -->|routing + middleware| Mux["gorilla/mux v1.8.1<br/>justinas/alice v1.2.0"]
    KAP -.->|optional sessions| GoRedis["go-redis v9.17.0<br/>redislock v0.9.4"]
    KAP -->|metrics| PromClient["prometheus client_golang v1.23.2"]
    KAP -->|FIPS build| GoToolset["ubi9/go-toolset 1.26<br/>strictfipsruntime"]
    KAP -->|runtime base| UBI["ubi9/ubi-minimal-pqc"]

    %% Platform dependencies
    KAP -->|TokenReview, users/~,<br/>OAuthAccessToken DELETE| K8sAPI["Kubernetes / OpenShift API"]
    KAP -->|OAuth2 login| OAuthSrv["OpenShift OAuth server"]
    KAP -.->|BYOIDC login/logout| IdP["External OIDC IdP"]
    KAP -.->|session tickets| Redis["Redis / Valkey"]

    %% Integration points
    Operator["rhods-operator"] -->|deploys| KAP
    Gateway["data-science-gateway<br/>Envoy ext_authz"] -->|/oauth2/auth| KAP
    KAP -->|JSON 401| MLflow["MLflow Python client"]
    KAP -.->|AuthZ delegated| KRP["kube-rbac-proxy / apps<br/>(RBAC/SAR)"]
    Prom["Prometheus"] -.->|scrape| KAP

